{"term":{"label":"親","occurrences":9,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"7A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i","title":"盡心上","description":"孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"下","id":"下"},{"form":"事","id":"事"},{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"君","id":"君"},{"form":"大","id":"大"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"弗","id":"弗"},{"form":"愛","id":"愛"},{"form":"民","id":"民"},{"form":"知","id":"知"},{"form":"臣","id":"臣"},{"form":"莫","id":"莫"},{"form":"親","id":"親"},{"form":"賢","id":"賢"},{"form":"食","id":"食"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.1837700970084166,"source":"人","target":"大"},{"weight":0.5596157879354227,"source":"人","target":"知"},{"weight":0.5596157879354227,"source":"人","target":"仁"},{"weight":1.1837700970084166,"source":"人","target":"事"},{"weight":1.1837700970084166,"source":"人","target":"君"},{"weight":1.6945957207744073,"source":"人","target":"臣"},{"weight":0.15415067982725836,"source":"人","target":"賢"},{"weight":0.4906229164484712,"source":"人","target":"莫"},{"weight":0.15415067982725836,"source":"人","target":"親"},{"weight":0.7137664677626809,"source":"人","target":"子"},{"weight":0.02061928720273561,"source":"人","target":"愛"},{"weight":0.8007778447523106,"source":"民","target":"愛"},{"weight":0.6466271649250525,"source":"民","target":"仁"},{"weight":0.5776342934381009,"source":"民","target":"大"},{"weight":0.24116205681688804,"source":"民","target":"親"},{"weight":2.0592388343623163,"source":"莫","target":"大"},{"weight":1.0296194171811581,"source":"莫","target":"仁"},{"weight":0.6241543090729939,"source":"莫","target":"下"},{"weight":2.0592388343623163,"source":"莫","target":"君"},{"weight":2.570064458128307,"source":"莫","target":"臣"},{"weight":1.7227665977411035,"source":"莫","target":"親"},{"weight":2.2823823856765264,"source":"莫","target":"弗"},{"weight":1.791759469228055